## Interface: 16001
## Title: BuffDrop
## Notes: In combat, a pulsing grey icon the moment a buff you keep up on yourself falls off: Battle Shout, shaman shields, seals, Slice and Dice, Inner Fire, armors, Thorns, aspects. /buffdrop to move it.
